{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-4-14","kind":"proposition","title":"五边等边等角形求作形外切圆","englishTitle":"About a given pentagon, which is equilateral and equiangular, to circumscribe a circle.","book":4,"number":14,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.14","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.14/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":14,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-4-14@raw-ec35afeac399a652","contentId":"euclid-4-14","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec35afeac399a6524d1a4015586d3d45e10e869629bcb29a44786e809aa1d735","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-4-14.statement","euclid-4-14.construction.1","euclid-4-14.construction.2","euclid-4-14.proof.1","euclid-4-14.proof.2","euclid-4-14.proof.3","euclid-4-14.proof.4","euclid-4-14.construction.3","euclid-4-14.conclusion","euclid-4-14.historical.1","euclid-4-14.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-4-14.statement","contentId":"euclid-4-14","revisionId":"euclid-4-14@raw-ec35afeac399a652","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6048b586fb8dfcedea273ed87477c62ed220610ee9dff5a3a04477f0f36cf44","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"About a given pentagon, which is equilateral and equiangular, to circumscribe a circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"有关一个对等和对角的五角形,以限定圆。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"五边等边等角形求作形外切圜"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将五边形等边三角形作为外接圆来寻找"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-14.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-4-14","revisionId":"euclid-4-14@raw-ec35afeac399a652","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ddf4b0acb4afdd397af20eb3b0609e138f867d9a8d4f0d5b520a0b5f2c09c53e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCDE be the given pentagon, which is equilateral and equiangular; thus it is required to circumscribe a circle about the pentagon ABCDE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCDE成为给定的五角形,即等边和等角形;因此,它必须环绕五角形ABCDE的圆。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-14.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-4-14","revisionId":"euclid-4-14@raw-ec35afeac399a652","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"21647fbd40cad9368f5f05008595f7f12bf21a93c400e505d8a7237367e787a9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angles BCD, CDE be bisected by the straight lines CF, DF respectively, and from the point F, at which the straight lines meet, let the straight lines FB, FA, FE be joined to the points B, A, E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让BCD、CDE角分别由CF、DF直线和F点两部分分割,从F点直线相交,让FB、FA、FE直线与B、A、E点连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-14.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-4-14","revisionId":"euclid-4-14@raw-ec35afeac399a652","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ab2e5c411bcf1f00d407899602889c53b47a4b749b89923214a49d981743ddd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then in manner similar to the preceding it can be proved that the angles CBA, BAE, AED have also been bisected by the straight lines FB, FA, FE respectively."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,与前述情况相似的是,可以证明CBA、BAE、AED角也分别被FB、FA、FE直线分两部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-14.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-4-14","revisionId":"euclid-4-14@raw-ec35afeac399a652","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"79b1392de91d4adb7d8fadec68f539846485a1b1734a00d9c2a2b560d83c0aad","citations":["euclid-1-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the angle BCD is equal to the angle CDE, and the angle FCD is half of the angle BCD, and the angle CDF half of the angle CDE, therefore the angle FCD is also equal to the angle CDF, so that the side FC is also equal to the side FD. [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,BCD角等于CDE角,FCD角等于BCD角的一半,CDE角的CDF角等于CDF角,因此,FCD角也等于CDF角,因此,FC角也等于FD角。 [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-14.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-4-14","revisionId":"euclid-4-14@raw-ec35afeac399a652","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fa5e2bf7fd815c76282eca84342a4a3c4320ecda6ddb400396ea78b52dc5dcd9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly it can be proved that each of the straight lines FB, FA, FE is also equal to each of the straight lines FC, FD; therefore the five straight lines FA, FB, FC, FD, FE are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,可以证明,FB、FA、FE直线的每一个也等于FC、FD直线的每一个;因此,5条直线FA、FB、FC、FD、FE直线是彼此相等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-14.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-4-14","revisionId":"euclid-4-14@raw-ec35afeac399a652","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9050dd346f0ead8f6f53c8f70fc7587826e0fa09d40b6dee030988329b1abc9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the circle described with centre F and distance one of the straight lines FA, FB, FC, FD, FE will pass also through the remaining points, and will have been circumscribed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,以F中心为主的圆圈和FA、FB、FC、FD、FE直线之一的距离也将穿过其余的点,并将加以限制。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-14.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-4-14","revisionId":"euclid-4-14@raw-ec35afeac399a652","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec7ec8c35322a9391927f3a33a9d1554fb0024758bb20ab705ac8f28300bc28d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be circumscribed, and let it be ABCDE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它被限制,让它成为ABCDE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-14.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-4-14","revisionId":"euclid-4-14@raw-ec35afeac399a652","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5810eb67f86ad91b5c6ccff8818342a24c6504ec7856f72da9cf861981035697","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore about the given pentagon, which is equilateral and equiangular, a circle has been circumscribed. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,对于属于等边和等角的五角形,一个圆圈被限定为Q.E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-14.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-4-14","revisionId":"euclid-4-14@raw-ec35afeac399a652","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e09bb45cd17a445194a5f71adbdaea705e54d19c92d59f21e633e5665981ce5d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"五边等边等角形求作形外切圜法曰甲乙丙丁戊五边等边等角形求作外切圜先分乙甲戊甲乙丙两角各两平分其线为己甲己乙而相遇于己〈说见前〉次从己作己丙己丁己戊三线依前题论推显乙丙丁丙丁戊丁戊甲三角各两平分于己丙己丁己戊三线夫五角既等即其半减之角亦等而甲乙己角形之己甲乙己乙甲两角等即甲己与己乙两线亦等〈一卷六〉依显己丙己丁己戊三线与己甲己乙俱等末作圜以己为心甲为界必过乙丙丁戊而为甲乙丙丁戊五边形之外切圜"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"构造五边形等边三角形的方法如下：甲乙丙丁戊 要找到一个五边形等边三角形，首先将两个角乙甲戊甲乙丙分开，并平分它们的每条线己甲己乙，它们在己相交。然后，从己和己丙己丁己戊画三条线，并推断三角形乙丙丁丙丁戊丁戊甲在己丙己丁己戊被平分。由于三个角相等，甲己和己乙的角也相等，因此甲己和己乙也相等。〈一卷六〉显示在己丙己丁己戊和己甲己乙上的三条线全部相等。最后，画一个圆，以己为中心，甲为边界。它必须经过乙丙丁戊，形成甲乙丙丁戊的外接圆。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-14.source","contentId":"euclid-4-14","revisionId":"euclid-4-14@raw-ec35afeac399a652","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a32c630162f67ca02bb0bcbc772e64be2b80279224d3714b476c4614a5f8095b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.14/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.14\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-14:euclid-1-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-14.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"I. 6"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-8:euclid-4-14:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-8.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-14","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"IV. 14"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-14:euclid-1-6:explicit","id":"euclid-1-6","book":1,"number":6,"kind":"proposition","title":"等腰三角形逆定理：等角对等边","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-8:euclid-4-14:explicit","id":"euclid-13-8","book":13,"number":8,"kind":"proposition","title":"正五边形对角线中的黄金分割","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-polygon","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
